Mel siger en masse godt om dig.

353
00:17:08,277 --> 00:17:09,111
Okay.

354
00:17:11,405 --> 00:17:13,366
Hvorfor er du her i dag?

355
00:17:13,449 --> 00:17:14,534
Jeg har mavepine.

356
00:17:15,159 --> 00:17:16,827
Mavepine? Hvor?

357
00:17:16,911 --> 00:17:18,955
Lige hernede.

358
00:17:19,038 --> 00:17:23,584
Oplever du andet eller kun mavepine?

359
